Native test of Comp.Count.dimCheck on msolve's reduced Groebner bases (test only, not part of the proof).
Bases: msolve 0.7.5, option -g 2 (reduced basis), graded reverse lexicographic order, p = 65521, on the inputs listed in
data/d88count/SHA256SUMS_br. Each basis was converted by gen/d88count/br_msolve2lst.py into term lists sorted in
grevGtStd order (coefficients in [1, p)) and read by gen/d88count/br_testdim.lean, built as a module of the
precompiled checker library, so that dimCheck runs as compiled code.

